        " بِئْرٍ فَمَاتَ قَالَ \"عَلَى اَلرَّجُلِ رُبُعُ دِيَةِ اَلصَّبِيِّ بِشَهَادَةِ اَلْمَرْأَةِ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.3313 - And Abdullah bin Al-Hakam asked Abu Abdullah (as), about a woman who testified against a man that he had pushed a boy into a well, resulting in his death.\nImam (as) said: \"The man is liable for one-fourth of the boy's blood money based on the testimony of the woman.\""
        ]
      }
